# Same Layer$ Control line as Captive Audience, with a DBCleanup that clears the
# chosen player afterwards (ClearChosenPlayer$): Pendant of Prosperity enters
# under ai's control.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
tapformana human 3 B
tapformana human 4 B
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
queue playerchoice ai
castspell human 1
resolvestack
